            "caption": "Rituals",
            "heading": "I Had Only Come For Tea",
            "description": "<p>An Afternoon in a Sindhi Home</p><p>Every home has a language. Some speak through walls, others through heirlooms. A Sindhi home, I discovered, speaks through what it places in front of you before it asks anything in return.</p>",
