            "caption": "Rituals",
            "heading": "The Extra Plate",
            "description": "<p>No One Asked Who Was Coming</p><p>Across many Indian homes, one extra plate was never an accident. It was a quiet habit, passed from one generation to the next. Long before guests announced their arrival, the kitchen had already prepared a place for them.</p>",
